{"title":"Balkan Mathematical Olympiad","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Balkan Mathematical Olympiad</b> (BMO) is an annual contest for students from one of the <a href=\"#Member_countries\">member countries</a> (Balkan area).  In recent years the hosts have also invited some non-member guest countries.\n</p>\n<table style=\"border:thin solid black;padding:10px;float:right;margin:10px;background:#fff;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"border:thin solid gray;text-align:center;background:#ccf;\"><b>Balkan MO</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Region</b>: Balkan Area\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Type</b>: Proof\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Competition_ratings\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Competition ratings\">Difficulty</a></b>: 6 - 8\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Difficulty Breakdown:</b>\n<p><u>Problem 1</u>: 6<br /><u>Problem 2</u>: 6.5<br /><u>Problem 3</u>: 7.5<br /><u>Problem 4</u>: 8\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Member_countries\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Member countries</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Albania\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Albania</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Bosnia_&amp;_Herzegovina\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Bosnia &amp; Herzegovina</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Bulgaria\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Bulgaria</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Cyprus\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Cyprus</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Hellas\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Hellas</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Former_Yugoslav_Republic_of_Macedonia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Former Yugoslav Republic of Macedonia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Republic_of_Moldova\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Republic of Moldova</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Romania\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Romania</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Turkey\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Turkey</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Past_BMOs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Past BMOs</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Member_countries\">Member countries</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Member countries\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Albania\">Albania</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Albania\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span id=\"Bosnia_.26_Herzegovina\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bosnia_&amp;_Herzegovina\">Bosnia &amp; Herzegovina</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Bosnia &amp; Herzegovina\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bulgaria\">Bulgaria</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Bulgaria\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Cyprus\">Cyprus</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Cyprus\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_mathematics_competitions#High_School_(Lyceum)_Competitions\" title=\"Cyprus mathematics competitions\">High School (Lyceum) Math Competitions in Cyprus</a>.</i>\n</p><p>In Cyprus <b>Four provincial competitions</b> and a <b>National (Pancyprian) competition</b> are held every year. During this procedure 30 students are selected and 4 <b>Team Selection Tests</b> are held to determine who will be the six member of national team for BMO.\n</p>\n<ul><li>In every competition or test there are four problem usually covering <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometry\" title=\"Geometry\">geometry</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Number_theory\" title=\"Number theory\">number theory</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Algebra\" title=\"Algebra\">algebra</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Combinatorics\" title=\"Combinatorics\">combinatorics</a> (elementary level) and last four hours each.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Hellas\">Hellas</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Hellas\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Θαλής (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Thales\" title=\"Thales\">Thalis</a>) - first round</li>\n<li>Ευκλείδης (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Euclides&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Euclides (page does not exist)\">Efklidis</a>) - second round</li>\n<li>Αρχιμήδης (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Archimedes\" title=\"Archimedes\">Archimidis</a>) - third round</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Former_Yugoslav_Republic_of_Macedonia\">Former Yugoslav Republic of Macedonia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Former Yugoslav Republic of Macedonia\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Republic_of_Moldova\">Republic of Moldova</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Republic of Moldova\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Romania\">Romania</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Romania\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Turkey\">Turkey</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Turkey\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Past_BMOs\">Past BMOs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Past BMOs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_BMO\" title=\"1984 BMO\">1st BMO</a> was held in Athens, Greece in 1984.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1985 BMO (page does not exist)\">2nd BMO</a> was held in Sofia, Bulgaria in 1985.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1986 BMO (page does not exist)\">3rd BMO</a> was held in Bucharest, Romania in 1986.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1987 BMO (page does not exist)\">4th BMO</a> was held in Athens, Greece in 1987.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1988 BMO (page does not exist)\">5th BMO</a> was held in Nicosia, Cyprus in 1988.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1989 BMO (page does not exist)\">6th BMO</a> was held in Split, Yugoslavia in 1989.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1990 BMO (page does not exist)\">7th BMO</a> was held in Sofia, Bulgaria in 1990.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1991 BMO (page does not exist)\">8th BMO</a> was held in Constanţa, Romania in 1991.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1992 BMO (page does not exist)\">9th BMO</a> was held in Athens, Greece in 1992.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1993 BMO (page does not exist)\">10th BMO</a> was held in Nicosia, Cyprus in 1993.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1994 BMO (page does not exist)\">11th BMO</a> was held in Novi Sad, Yugoslavia in 1994.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1995 BMO (page does not exist)\">12th BMO</a> was held in Plovdiv, Bulgaria in 1995.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1996 BMO (page does not exist)\">13th BMO</a> was held in Bacău, Romania in 1996.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1997 BMO (page does not exist)\">14th BMO</a> was held in Kalambaka, Greece in 1997.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1998 BMO (page does not exist)\">15th BMO</a> was held in Nicosia, Cyprus in 1998.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 BMO (page does not exist)\">16th BMO</a> was held in Ohrid, Former Yugoslav Republic of Macedonia (FYROM) in 1999.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2000 BMO (page does not exist)\">17th BMO</a> was held in Chişinău, Moldova in 2000.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2001 BMO (page does not exist)\">18th BMO</a> was held in Belgrade, Yugoslavia in 2001.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2002 BMO (page does not exist)\">19th BMO</a> was held in Antalya, Turkey in 2002.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2003 BMO (page does not exist)\">20th BMO</a> was held in Tirana, Albania in 2003.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2004 BMO (page does not exist)\">21st BMO</a> was held in Pleven, Bulgaria in 2004.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2005 BMO (page does not exist)\">22nd BMO</a> was held in Iaşi, Romania on 4-10 May, 2005. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://www.rms.unibuc.ro/balkan.html\">[1]</a></li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 BMO (page does not exist)\">23rd BMO</a> was held in Agros, Cyprus on 27 April-3 May, 2006. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://www.cms.org.cy/memannouncBMO06.htm\">[2]</a></li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_BMO\" title=\"2007 BMO\">24th BMO</a> was held in Rhodes, Greece in 2007.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2008 BMO (page does not exist)\">25th BMO</a> was held in Ohrid, FYROM in 2008.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2009 BMO (page does not exist)\">26th BMO</a> was held in Kragujevac, Serbia in 2009.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2010 BMO (page does not exist)\">27th BMO</a> was held in Chisinau, Moldova in 210.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2011 BMO (page does not exist)\">28th BMO</a> was held in Iasi, Romania in 2011.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 BMO (page does not exist)\">29th BMO</a> was held in Antalya, Turkeyin 2012.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 BMO (page does not exist)\">30th BMO</a> was held in Agros, Cyprus in 2013.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 BMO (page does not exist)\">31st BMO</a> was held in Pleven, Bulgaria in 2014.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 BMO (page does not exist)\">32nd BMO</a> was held in Athens, Greece on 3-8 May, 2015.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 BMO (page does not exist)\">33th BMO</a> was held in Tirana, Albania on 5-10 May, 2016.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_BMO\" title=\"2017 BMO\">34th BMO</a> was held in Ohrid, FYROM on 2-7 May 2017.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Balkan_MO_Problems_and_Solutions,_with_authors\" title=\"Balkan MO Problems and Solutions, with authors\">Balkan MO Problems and Solutions, with authors</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Junior_Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad\" title=\"Junior Balkan Mathematical Olympiad\">Junior Balkan Mathematical Olympiad</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competition resources\">Mathematics competition resources</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_books\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Math books\">Math books</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of mathematics competitions\">List of mathematics competitions</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018074130\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.052 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 98/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 420/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 122/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.373      1 Template:Contest_Info\n100.00%    7.373      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:4113:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018074130 and revision id 284308. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}